{"lang": "zh_TW", "eventid": "act49side", "eventName": "辭歲行", "entryType": "ACTIVITY", "storyCode": "TA-7", "avgTag": "行動前", "storyName": "相思斷", "storyInfo": "記憶的迷宮中，二十年轉瞬即逝。在執白者的攪弄下，望不得已孤身赴局。然而，歲陵之中，事情已出乎其所料。\n", "storyList": [{"id": 0, "prop": "HEADER", "attributes": {"key": "title_test", "is_skippable": "true", "fit_mode": "BLACK_MASK"}}, {"id": 1, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 2, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 3, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 4, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 5, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "70_g2_tjlibrary", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 6, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 7, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 8, "prop": "animtext", "attributes": {"content": "<p=1>982年</>", "id": "at1", "name": "group_location_stamp", "style": "avg_only_heavy", "pos": "-400,-200", "block": "false", "p": 1.0}}, {"id": 9, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 3.0}}, {"id": 10, "prop": "animtextclean", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 11, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 12, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.6, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 13, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"key": "$saferoom_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 14, "prop": "Subtitle", "attributes": {"text": "二十年的時間，的確漫長。", "x": 300.0, "y": 320.0, "alignment": "center", "size": 24.0, "delay": 0.04, "width": 700.0}}, {"id": 15, "prop": "Subtitle", "attributes": {"text": "大炎將一整座城市搬上了移動平台，在許多遙遠的地方，還有無數座這樣的移動城市拔地而起。", "x": 300.0, "y": 320.0, "alignment": "center", "size": 24.0, "delay": 0.04, "width": 700.0}}, {"id": 16, "prop": "Subtitle", "attributes": {"text": "從各地收錄的書卷很多，天鏡閣在二十年中擴建了幾番，已經是我完全認不出原貌的宏偉建築。", "x": 300.0, "y": 320.0, "alignment": "center", "size": 24.0, "delay": 0.04, "width": 700.0}}, {"id": 17, "prop": "Subtitle", "attributes": {"text": "二十年的時間，也的確短暫。", "x": 300.0, "y": 320.0, "alignment": "center", "size": 24.0, "delay": 0.04, "width": 700.0}}, {"id": 18, "prop": "Subtitle", "attributes": {"text": "我們一家人聚少離多。", "x": 300.0, "y": 320.0, "alignment": "center", "size": 24.0, "delay": 0.04, "width": 700.0}}, {"id": 19, "prop": "Subtitle", "attributes": {"text": "大哥大姐依舊在戍邊，二姐協助修訂了《炎律》後正打算移住丹燕，黍長居大荒，績遊歷四海，易遍訪山川，年還是那樣到處遊戲。", "x": 300.0, "y": 320.0, "alignment": "center", "size": 24.0, "delay": 0.04, "width": 700.0}}, {"id": 20, "prop": "Subtitle", "attributes": {"text": "方弟據說已經出了大炎地界，小夕還是不肯從自己的畫卷裡出來，么弟的飯館倒是生意興隆，幾十年如一日。", "x": 300.0, "y": 320.0, "alignment": "center", "size": 24.0, "delay": 0.04, "width": 700.0}}, {"id": 21, "prop": "Subtitle", "attributes": {"text": "至於二哥……", "x": 300.0, "y": 320.0, "alignment": "center", "size": 24.0, "delay": 0.04, "width": 700.0}}, {"id": 22, "prop": "Subtitle", "attributes": {"text": "他將自己鎖在一間古寺裡，為了精進“棋藝”，就這樣枯坐了二十年……", "x": 300.0, "y": 320.0, "alignment": "center", "size": 24.0, "delay": 0.04, "width": 700.0}}, {"id": 23, "prop": "Subtitle", "attributes": {"text": "……他到底什麼時候，才願意與我再見一面呢？", "x": 300.0, "y": 320.0, "alignment": "center", "size": 24.0, "delay": 0.04, "width": 700.0}}, {"id": 24, "prop": "subtitle", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 25, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 26, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 27, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 28, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2125_1#9$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 29, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 30, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "頡"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2125_1#9$1"}, {"id": 31, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 32, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 33, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2127_1#1$2", "duration": 0.5}}, {"id": 34, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 35, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "頡，太史閣那邊在催姜齊地方志的審校，不過——", "name": "椿"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2127_1#1$2"}, {"id": 36, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2125_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 37, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "偷閒被你抓到了。", "name": "頡"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2125_1#1$1"}, {"id": 38, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2127_1#3$2"}}, {"id": 39, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……你偷閒也沒問題啦。那本地方志我校對過一遍，有問題的地方都圈起來了。你還要再看一下嗎？", "name": "椿"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2127_1#3$2"}, {"id": 40, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 41, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$book_close"}}, {"id": 42, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2125_1#3$1"}}, {"id": 43, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 44, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "咦？真奇怪，這本書是什麼時候……", "name": "頡"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2125_1#3$1"}, {"id": 45, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2127_1#13$2"}}, {"id": 46, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "唉……你有空還是多歇歇吧，人都變糊塗了。這些年，我幾乎是看著你工作的時間一點一點增多，睡覺的時間一點一點變少……", "name": "椿"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2127_1#13$2"}, {"id": 47, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "各移動城市的地方志、建城史，上代真龍的實錄，學宮古代史部分的教材……這麼多書，我只是幫你整理，有時候都覺得累到不行。", "name": "椿"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2127_1#13$2"}, {"id": 48, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "真奇怪，我聽說工部給年的委託越來越少，黍在大荒城的任務也沒那麼繁重了。", "name": "椿"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2127_1#13$2"}, {"id": 49, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但好像只有你，身上的擔子始終卸不下……", "name": "椿"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2127_1#13$2"}, {"id": 50, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2125_1#4$1"}}, {"id": 51, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "頡"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2125_1#4$1"}, {"id": 52, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2127_1#5$2"}}, {"id": 53, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "頡？", "name": "椿"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2127_1#5$2"}, {"id": 54, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2125_1#5$1"}}, {"id": 55, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "嗯……？", "name": "頡"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2125_1#5$1"}, {"id": 56, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2125_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 57, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "抱歉，剛剛有點恍神了。", "name": "頡"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2125_1#1$1"}, {"id": 58, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "椿，今天的確有點累了，我想暫時先放下這些工作……", "name": "頡"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2125_1#1$1"}, {"id": 59, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2127_1#3$2"}}, {"id": 60, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "好啊，不然我們去街上逛逛？", "name": "椿"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2127_1#3$2"}, {"id": 61, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2125_1#4$1"}}, {"id": 62, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……不了。今天不知為何，有點心神不寧。你先去吧。", "name": "頡"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2125_1#4$1"}, {"id": 63, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2125_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 64, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "若是有什麼有趣的東西，別忘了帶一點給我。", "name": "頡"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2125_1#1$1"}, {"id": 65, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 66, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 67, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 68, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 69, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 70, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "70_g1_tjoutside", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 71, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 72, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 73, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"intro": "$suspenseful_intro", "key": "$suspenseful_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 74, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_1632_1#1$1", "duration": 0.5}}, {"id": 75, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 76, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "椿秉燭。", "name": "嚴肅的炎國官員"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1632_1#1$1"}, {"id": 77, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2127_1#1$2"}}, {"id": 78, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "是我，請問您找我……", "name": "椿"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2127_1#1$2"}, {"id": 79, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_1632_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 80, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "有封要緊的信帶給您。", "name": "嚴肅的炎國官員"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1632_1#1$1"}, {"id": 81, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2127_1#1$2"}}, {"id": 82, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "您……帶信給我？誰寄來的？", "name": "椿"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2127_1#1$2"}, {"id": 83, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_1632_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 84, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不知是誰寄了封信給司歲台，監正閱後大驚失色，將這封信轉呈陛下，同時也發送給各位直接接觸代理人的秉燭人。", "name": "嚴肅的炎國官員"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1632_1#1$1"}, {"id": 85, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2127_1#5$2"}}, {"id": 86, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "這裡面是……？", "name": "椿"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2127_1#5$2"}, {"id": 87, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_1632_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 88, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我也不知。監正只說讓各位先做好準備，不要輕舉妄動。", "name": "嚴肅的炎國官員"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1632_1#1$1"}, {"id": 89, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 90, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "posfrom": "0,0", "posto": "200,0", "duration": 1.0, "afrom": 1.0, "ato": 0.0}}, {"id": 91, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.5}}, {"id": 92, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 93, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2127_1#11$2"}}, {"id": 94, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "這裡面說的是……", "name": "椿"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2127_1#11$2"}, {"id": 95, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 96, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_paper1"}}, {"id": 97, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.6, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.5, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 98, "prop": "Sticker", "attributes": {"id": "st1", "multi": "true", "text": "■■年，出世。", "x": 300.0, "y": 220.0, "alignment": "left", "size": 24.0, "delay": 0.04, "width": 700.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 99, "prop": "Sticker", "attributes": {"id": "st1", "multi": "true", "text": "\\n\\n■■年，與朔相搏，毀壞黎民生計無算。", "x": 300.0, "y": 270.0, "alignment": "left", "size": 24.0, "delay": 0.04, "width": 700.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 100, "prop": "Sticker", "attributes": {"id": "st1", "multi": "true", "text": "\\n\\n……", "x": 300.0, "y": 330.0, "alignment": "center", "size": 24.0, "delay": 0.04, "width": 700.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 101, "prop": "Sticker", "attributes": {"id": "st1", "duration": 0.5}}, {"id": 102, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 103, "prop": "Sticker", "attributes": {"id": "st1", "multi": "true", "text": "■■年，包庇同族，構陷官吏，使人蒙不白之冤。", "x": 300.0, "y": 220.0, "alignment": "left", "size": 24.0, "delay": 0.04, "width": 700.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 104, "prop": "Sticker", "attributes": {"id": "st1", "multi": "true", "text": "\\n\\n■■年，躲避司歲台監視，與其餘代理人私會。數月之後，司歲台失火，主犯成謎。", "x": 300.0, "y": 270.0, "alignment": "left", "size": 24.0, "delay": 0.04, "width": 700.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 105, "prop": "Sticker", "attributes": {"id": "st1", "multi": "true", "text": "\\n\\n■■年，謊稱誅殺矩獸，實則包庇，坐視其離開大炎。", "x": 300.0, "y": 270.0, "alignment": "left", "size": 24.0, "delay": 0.04, "width": 700.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 106, "prop": "Sticker", "attributes": {"id": "st1", "multi": "true", "text": "\\n\\n……", "x": 300.0, "y": 330.0, "alignment": "center", "size": 24.0, "delay": 0.04, "width": 700.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 107, "prop": "Sticker", "attributes": {"id": "st1", "duration": 0.5}}, {"id": 108, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.5, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 109, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2127_1#10$2"}}, {"id": 110, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "陷害官吏、私會、失火、包庇巨獸……", "name": "椿"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2127_1#10$2"}, {"id": 111, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "這說的是……", "name": "椿"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2127_1#10$2"}, {"id": 112, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2127_1#11$2"}}, {"id": 113, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……望？", "name": "椿"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2127_1#11$2"}, {"id": 114, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "這真的是望做過的事？但為什麼司歲台的記錄沒有這些？！", "name": "椿"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2127_1#11$2"}, {"id": 115, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 116, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 117, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_1632_1#1$1", "duration": 0.5, "bstart": 0.2, "bend": 0.6}}, {"id": 118, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 119, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2127_1#5$2"}}, {"id": 120, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你——你沒走？！", "name": "椿"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2127_1#5$2"}, {"id": 121, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_1632_1#1$1", "bstart": 0.2, "bend": 0.6}}, {"id": 122, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "另有一句話帶給椿秉燭。", "name": "嚴肅的炎國官員？"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1632_1#1$1"}, {"id": 123, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "先誅大惡，再除元兇。", "name": "嚴肅的炎國官員？"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1632_1#1$1"}, {"id": 124, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 125, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "posfrom": "0,0", "duration": 1.0, "afrom": 1.0, "ato": 0.0}}, {"id": 126, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.5}}, {"id": 127, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_walkfast"}}, {"id": 128, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "更加惶恐的秉燭人快步走回天鏡閣，與從天鏡閣出門的朝官擦肩而過。"}}, {"id": 129, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 130, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 131, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 132, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 133, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "70_g4_tjdiscussionroom", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 134, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 135, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 136, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_1633_1#1$1", "bstart": 0.2, "bend": 0.6, "duration": 0.5}}, {"id": 137, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_1630_1#1$1", "bstart": 0.2, "bend": 0.6, "duration": 0.5}}, {"id": 138, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 139, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 140, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "聽說了嗎？那個頡的事情。", "name": "耳目靈通的高官？"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1633_1#1$1"}, {"id": 141, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 142, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "聽說了。頡亂修史書，天鏡閣和太史閣加起來沒人轄治得住她，長此以往，如何是好！", "name": "愛民如子的言官？"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1630_1#1$1"}, {"id": 143, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 144, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "她的那個秉燭人也是失職。將來大炎歷史一片混沌，她擔得起這個責嗎？", "name": "耳目靈通的高官？"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1633_1#1$1"}, {"id": 145, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 146, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"duration": 0.5}}, {"id": 147, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "秉燭人條件反射般轉頭看向那兩個人的方向，只看見兩個快步離開的影子。"}}, {"id": 148, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "她心神不寧，從架上拿起一本司歲台留下的卷宗。"}}, {"id": 149, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 150, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2127_1#1$2"}}, {"id": 151, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "■■年，出世——", "name": "椿"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2127_1#1$2"}, {"id": 152, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2127_1#5$2"}}, {"id": 153, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "？！", "name": "椿"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2127_1#5$2"}, {"id": 154, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 155, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "秉燭人知道一定有什麼不對，但她的眼睛卻無法控制地跟著一行一行的字跡輪轉。"}}, {"id": 156, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2127_1#5$2"}}, {"id": 157, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "■■年，把持天鏡閣、太史閣。用心雖純，卻無人可以轄治。", "name": "椿"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2127_1#5$2"}, {"id": 158, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "■■年，真龍欲伐歲以除頡害，啟歲陵，陵中空無一物。", "name": "椿"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2127_1#5$2"}, {"id": 159, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "■■年，廢太史閣，修大炎文字，無人可以不遵。", "name": "椿"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2127_1#5$2"}, {"id": 160, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "■■年，察萬民生計，其中凡有詐偽者，皆抹去姓名，流放邊陲，死者千計——", "name": "椿"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2127_1#5$2"}, {"id": 161, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2127_1#8$2"}}, {"id": 162, "prop": "CameraShake", "attributes": {"duration": 0.3, "xstrength": 30.0, "ystrength": 30.0, "vibrato": 30.0, "randomness": 90.0, "fadeout": "true", "block": "false"}}, {"id": 163, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "這不是真的，這不是真的，她不是這樣的人！", "name": "椿"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2127_1#8$2"}, {"id": 164, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 165, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "幾個來看書的人好奇地看向這個秉燭人服色的傢伙。椿擦了擦額頭上的冷汗，再看向手裡的書，卻發現那不過是一本詩集。"}}, {"id": 166, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2127_1#13$2"}}, {"id": 167, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我一定是中邪了。對，她不是這樣的人。", "name": "椿"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2127_1#13$2"}, {"id": 168, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 169, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "她永遠都不會是這樣的人嗎？", "name": "？？？"}}, {"id": 170, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2127_1#8$2"}}, {"id": 171, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "她當然不是！", "name": "椿"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2127_1#8$2"}, {"id": 172, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 173, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "驚恐的秉燭人已經無暇分辨到底是誰在向自己搭話。"}}, {"id": 174, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "然而當她的力量無限膨脹時，她也會變的。她會成為祂。", "name": "？？？"}}, {"id": 175, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2127_1#5$2"}}, {"id": 176, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "祂……？", "name": "椿"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2127_1#5$2"}, {"id": 177, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 178, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 179, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2127_1#1$2", "duration": 1.0, "bstart": 0.2, "bend": 0.6}}, {"id": 180, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 181, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但她不想成為祂。", "name": "？？？"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2127_1#1$2"}, {"id": 182, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "她在向你求助，她不想變成那副模樣。", "name": "？？？"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2127_1#1$2"}, {"id": 183, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "大炎在向你求助，大炎不能接受這樣的結局。", "name": "？？？"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2127_1#1$2"}, {"id": 184, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "成為比歲獸本身，都更加強大、更加恐怖的力量，她沒辦法不這麼做。", "name": "？？？"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2127_1#1$2"}, {"id": 185, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你得幫她，只有你能幫助她……", "name": "？？？"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2127_1#1$2"}, {"id": 186, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2127_1#5$2"}}, {"id": 187, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但我……不能……", "name": "椿"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2127_1#5$2"}, {"id": 188, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2127_1#1$2", "bstart": 0.2, "bend": 0.6}}, {"id": 189, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你會做出那個對所有人都好的選擇的。", "name": "？？？"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2127_1#1$2"}, {"id": 190, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 191, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2129_1#1$1", "bstart": 0.2, "bend": 0.6, "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 192, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 1.0, "g": 1.0, "b": 1.0, "fadetime": 0.3, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 193, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 194, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"duration": 0.5}}, {"id": 195, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 196, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2127_1#13$2", "duration": 0.5}}, {"id": 197, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 198, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "對所有人都好的……選擇……？", "name": "椿"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2127_1#13$2"}, {"id": 199, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "等等，剛剛跟我搭話的究竟是誰？！", "name": "椿"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2127_1#13$2"}, {"id": 200, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 201, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "只有那些話語的迴響在她耳邊轟鳴，久久不散。"}}, {"id": 202, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 203, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 204, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 205, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 3.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 206, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 207, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 208, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_rainlight_loop", "loop": "true", "channel": "r", "volume": 0.0}}, {"id": 209, "prop": "SoundVolume", "attributes": {"volume": 1.0, "channel": "r", "fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 210, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 211, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_walkfast"}}, {"id": 212, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 213, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "陛下？", "name": "？？？"}}, {"id": 214, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 215, "prop": "CameraEffect", "attributes": {"effect": "Grayscale", "fadetime": 0.0, "amount": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 216, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "58_g5_dragonpalace", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 217, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 218, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 219, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"intro": "$loneliness_intro", "key": "$loneliness_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 220, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "年輕的官員緩步走入這座輝煌的宮殿，這是她第一次踏足此處。"}}, {"id": 221, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那位九五至尊之人此刻卻不在皇位上，而是站在靠近窗邊的位置，望著窗外連綿的雨幕。"}}, {"id": 222, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……你應該知道，太師昨日去世了。", "name": "真龍"}}, {"id": 223, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "他是你的老師，也是我的老師。", "name": "真龍"}}, {"id": 224, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "他臨終前向我舉薦過你，說你是他最得意的學生，“可以重任相託”。", "name": "真龍"}}, {"id": 225, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "有些話，我來不及問他，便只好來問問你。", "name": "真龍"}}, {"id": 226, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "陛下請問，微臣恭聽。", "name": "學識淵博的女性"}}, {"id": 227, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "二十年前，太師曾經力阻我修建移動城市，說此為苛政。而作為人君，第一要務應當是“節用恤民”。", "name": "真龍"}}, {"id": 228, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "二十年來，有人說大炎邊疆安穩，國庫殷實，是千年未有之盛世。", "name": "真龍"}}, {"id": 229, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "有人說大炎宇內疲弊，民怨載道。", "name": "真龍"}}, {"id": 230, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我想問你，在你看來，我做錯了嗎？", "name": "真龍"}}, {"id": 231, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "陛下，臣以為，我一人沒有評判陛下的資格。", "name": "學識淵博的女性"}}, {"id": 232, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "若我是安居於移動城市中衣食無憂的富賈，稱頌陛下英明無雙，這樣的讚詞能否算得上忠言？", "name": "學識淵博的女性"}}, {"id": 233, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "若我是家人死於勞役的普通百姓，怒責陛下昏庸暴戾，政令一無是處，這樣的批評又能否算得上公正？", "name": "學識淵博的女性"}}, {"id": 234, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "臣反而想請問陛下……", "name": "學識淵博的女性"}}, {"id": 235, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "陛下真正在意的，到底是後世的評價，還是別的什麼東西？", "name": "學識淵博的女性"}}, {"id": 236, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你倒是會說話。", "name": "真龍"}}, {"id": 237, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "好，那就不讓你評判對錯，你就代替你的老師，再給我一句諫言吧。", "name": "真龍"}}, {"id": 238, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "老師他曾說過一句話，臣自以為終身受用……", "name": "學識淵博的女性"}}, {"id": 239, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "“世事詭隨，謹致良知。”", "name": "學識淵博的女性"}}, {"id": 240, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "尋常百姓的一生尚且難以在世事紛紜中尋得一個公正的評價，何況是陛下您？", "name": "學識淵博的女性"}}, {"id": 241, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "這世上不存在可以評判陛下功過的法度，但陛下心中一定有衡量得失的良知。", "name": "學識淵博的女性"}}, {"id": 242, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "謹致良知……", "name": "真龍"}}, {"id": 243, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "如果我心中的良知告訴我，我事事皆無過錯，那又當如何？", "name": "真龍"}}, {"id": 244, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那陛下今天，也不會召見我了。", "name": "學識淵博的女性"}}, {"id": 245, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "只是想提醒陛下，炎國的百姓，他們不認識陛下，卻能夠看到陛下。", "name": "學識淵博的女性"}}, {"id": 246, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但陛下在這座禁城中，想要看清百姓，繼而看清自己的得失，那就要多花一番功夫了。", "name": "學識淵博的女性"}}, {"id": 247, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……這番話，我也記下了。", "name": "真龍"}}, {"id": 248, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "如果我還有下一個二十年……我都會記著的。", "name": "真龍"}}, {"id": 249, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "太師對他的學生的評價，不為偏頗……明日起，先去禮部報到吧。", "name": "真龍"}}, {"id": 250, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "謝陛下。", "name": "學識淵博的女性"}}, {"id": 251, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 252, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_gen_walk_n", "loop": "true", "channel": "bgs"}}, {"id": 253, "prop": "StopSound", "attributes": {"channel": "bgs", "fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 254, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 255, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.5}}, {"id": 256, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "疲憊的真龍踱步回了皇位邊，他的桌案上呈著一份罪狀。"}}, {"id": 257, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "司歲台送來的罪狀。"}}, {"id": 258, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "世事詭隨，謹致良知……", "name": "真龍"}}, {"id": 259, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "生年不滿百，常懷……千歲憂。", "name": "真龍"}}, {"id": 260, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "功過得失，自可交給後人評論……但大炎的頑疾，絕不可留待後世。", "name": "真龍"}}, {"id": 261, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "來人。", "name": "真龍"}}, {"id": 262, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 263, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_1634_1#1$1", "duration": 0.5}}, {"id": 264, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 265, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "在。", "name": "禁軍"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1634_1#1$1"}, {"id": 266, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 267, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "叫軍隊即刻就位。", "name": "真龍"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1634_1#1$1"}, {"id": 268, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……準備開啟歲陵。 ", "name": "真龍"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1634_1#1$1"}, {"id": 269, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 270, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 271, "prop": "StopSound", "attributes": {"channel": "r", "fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 272, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 3.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 273, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 274, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 275, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "bg_yanshabbyroom", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 276, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 277, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 278, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"intro": "$storyendjp_intro", "key": "$storyendjp_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 279, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "又是一個漫長而疲憊的白天過去。"}}, {"id": 280, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "代理人回到那間熟悉的古寺，目光習慣性地投向角落裡的棋枰，只是一瞥，他便敏銳地察覺到了某種異樣。"}}, {"id": 281, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "有人來過這裡。"}}, {"id": 282, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "他的棋枰上乾乾淨淨，只有正中央放著什麼東西。光線晦暗，他看不太清楚。"}}, {"id": 283, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "他走上前去，才發現棋盤天元處放著一枚圓潤飽滿的白色銀杏果。"}}, {"id": 284, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 285, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#1$2", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 286, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 287, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "望"}, "figure_art": "avg_2027_wang_1#1$2"}, {"id": 288, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 289, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.5, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 290, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 291, "prop": "CameraEffect", "attributes": {"effect": "Grayscale", "fadetime": 0.0, "keep": "true", "initamount": 0.0, "amount": 0.7, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 292, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "58_g5_dragonpalace", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 293, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.5, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 294, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你看庭中那株銀杏，是今年春天剛種下的苗。", "name": "真龍"}}, {"id": 295, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "幾天前，工部尚書在這裡立下過軍令狀，在銀杏樹掛果之前，他定然讓百灶改建為完整的移動城市。", "name": "真龍"}}, {"id": 296, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "二十年……我也給你二十年的時間。", "name": "真龍"}}, {"id": 297, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……"}}, {"id": 298, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "近乎無限的壽命讓你們傲慢，你們大概是忘了，尋常人一生，又能有幾個二十年？", "name": "真龍"}}, {"id": 299, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "炎國等不起，我也不願再等。", "name": "真龍"}}, {"id": 300, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 301, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.5, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 302, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 303, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#1$2"}}, {"id": 304, "prop": "CameraEffect", "attributes": {"effect": "Grayscale", "fadetime": 0.0, "amount": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 305, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "bg_yanshabbyroom", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 306, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.5, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 307, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……何必催促？", "name": "望"}, "figure_art": "avg_2027_wang_1#1$2"}, {"id": 308, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我早有此意。", "name": "望"}, "figure_art": "avg_2027_wang_1#1$2"}, {"id": 309, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 310, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 311, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 312, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_gen_walk_n"}}, {"id": 313, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 314, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "70_g6_suilingcorridor", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 315, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 316, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 317, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$flashback", "volume": 0.7}}, {"id": 318, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 319, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 320, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 321, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_2024_chyue_1#8$1"}}, {"id": 322, "prop": "CameraEffect", "attributes": {"effect": "Grayscale", "fadetime": 0.0, "keep": "true", "initamount": 0.0, "amount": 0.7, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 323, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "70_g11_oldpavilion", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 324, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 325, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "若你真計算出了一條行得通的路，那就告訴我，我情願與你同去，勝算還大一點。", "name": "朔"}, "figure_art": "avg_2024_chyue_1#8$1"}, {"id": 326, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "只要你告訴我，你究竟有幾成勝算。我可以任你差遣，哪怕要我的命我也絕無怨言。", "name": "朔"}, "figure_art": "avg_2024_chyue_1#8$1"}, {"id": 327, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……但你知道自己在做什麼嗎？", "name": "朔"}, "figure_art": "avg_2024_chyue_1#8$1"}, {"id": 328, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 329, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 330, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 331, "prop": "CameraEffect", "attributes": {"effect": "Grayscale", "fadetime": 0.0, "amount": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 332, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "70_g6_suilingcorridor", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 333, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 334, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "這本是無解的死局。"}}, {"id": 335, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "分身如何戰勝整體？“自己”如何能殺死“自己”而後倖存？"}}, {"id": 336, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但是他看到了那唯一的出路，對他們所有人而言的出路。"}}, {"id": 337, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "由自己……取而代之。"}}, {"id": 338, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 339, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$flashback", "volume": 0.7}}, {"id": 340, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 341, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 342, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2125_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 343, "prop": "CameraEffect", "attributes": {"effect": "Grayscale", "fadetime": 0.0, "keep": "true", "initamount": 0.0, "amount": 0.7, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 344, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "bg_indoor", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 345, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 346, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "也許有朝一日，我們擁有的力量會超越祂，到那時，我們就能夠擺脫祂的影響，真正作為“我們”而活著。", "name": "頡"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2125_1#1$1"}, {"id": 347, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "當然前提是，我們絕對不可以忘了自己是誰。", "name": "頡"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2125_1#1$1"}, {"id": 348, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 349, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.5, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 350, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 351, "prop": "CameraEffect", "attributes": {"effect": "Grayscale", "fadetime": 0.0, "amount": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 352, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#1$2", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 353, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "70_g6_suilingcorridor", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 354, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.5, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 355, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 356, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "謀士早已做好了準備。"}}, {"id": 357, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "棋路謀算一道，他於這片大地上已無敵手——這是他錨定的自我，也是積蓄了千年的力量。"}}, {"id": 358, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "而他要面對的，僅僅只是一片沉寂許久的殘破的意識。"}}, {"id": 359, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "這一局，無論如何都不容失敗——"}}, {"id": 360, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 361, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#11$2"}}, {"id": 362, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……久違了。", "name": "望"}, "figure_art": "avg_2027_wang_1#11$2"}, {"id": 363, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "傲慢的……無動於衷的……“我”。", "name": "望"}, "figure_art": "avg_2027_wang_1#11$2"}, {"id": 364, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 365, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 366, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 367, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "70_g7_suilingcore", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 368, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 369, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 370, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "終於回到這座闊別千年的幽暗的墓室，過往的無數種情緒一一湧上心間。"}}, {"id": 371, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "憤怒、不甘、屈辱……"}}, {"id": 372, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 1.0}}, {"id": 373, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "當他真正踏足這裡的瞬間，他突然感受到了一種深入骨髓的寒意。"}}, {"id": 374, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 375, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"intro": "$m_act31side_bat2_intro", "key": "$m_act31side_bat2_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 376, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#6$2", "duration": 0.5}}, {"id": 377, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 378, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不……不對！", "name": "望"}, "figure_art": "avg_2027_wang_1#6$2"}, {"id": 379, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 380, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "這怎麼可能？這絕無可能！"}}, {"id": 381, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你……為何已經醒來？"}}, {"id": 382, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 383, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 384, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2129_1#1$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 385, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 386, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 387, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 388, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 389, "prop": "bgeffect", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 390, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 391, "prop": "hidecgitem", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 392, "prop": "Image", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 393, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 394, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": ""}}], "OPTIONTRACE": true}